[DataWorks console](https://workbench.data.aliyun.com/console)', example='project_root,project.file1,project.001_out'),
  inputParameters?: string(name='InputParameters', description='The context input parameters of the node. The parameter value must be in JSON format. For the fields included, refer to the InputContextParameterList parameter structure in the response of the [GetFile](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/173954.html) operation.

